<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>单治法 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E5%8D%95%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 10:10:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E5%8D%95%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>单治法：论诸痛治肝 论吐泻各症治胃</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/3-34-danzhifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 10:03:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/3-34-danzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“单治法”部分，专论面对多经同病、症状纷繁之证，&lt;strong&gt;抓住关键脏腑，单治一经而使诸症自愈&lt;/strong&gt;的治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;满身上下俱病，当求其本而专治之，不可头痛救头、脚痛救脚。肝郁则周身气机不畅，胃虚则诸恙蜂起，故舒肝或健胃，常可收一发中的、全身皆安之效&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>